  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Spiders in motion, rainy commotion is an ongoing collection of proverbs made by Tomás Saraceno in the context of his exhibition Tomás Saraceno In Collaboration: Web(s) of Life, that takes place at Serpentine, London, between June 1 and September 10, 2023. This artist's book was specifically commissioned by Ivorypress as part of an ongoing series. Ivorypress wishes to thank the artist for his trust and collaboration"--Colophon.</subfield>
